{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836418",
      "title": "Introducing & Understanding \"Portals\"",
      "sourceHash": "82ce074c6f12871bd56b0cf2d530f75c1900b42e40efed895cf9dac9cab3321b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.84,
          "end": 1.74,
          "en": "Now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.74,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "we're almost done for this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 8.52,
          "en": "You learned a lot about refs and passing data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.52,
          "end": 10.593,
          "en": "between components and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.61,
          "end": 12.72,
          "en": "But wait a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.72,
          "end": 15.981,
          "en": "This section also is about portals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.981,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "and that's therefore what we'll tackle next",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 21.24,
          "en": "to then conclude this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.24,
          "end": 24.06,
          "en": "So what's this portals feature all about,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.06,
          "end": 25.98,
          "en": "and how can you use it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.98,
          "end": 29.34,
          "en": "To understand the idea behind portals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.34,
          "end": 31.95,
          "en": "let's make sure that we see such a modal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.95,
          "end": 34.44,
          "en": "for example because we won.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.44,
          "end": 36.933,
          "en": "And let's then inspect this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.7,
          "end": 42.96,
          "en": "If we do that, you see that this dialogue element here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.96,
          "end": 47.94,
          "en": "in my DOM is inserted anywhere in that DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.94,
          "end": 51.663,
          "en": "nested in other HTML elements in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.04,
          "end": 55.53,
          "en": "And that's of course the case because this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.53,
          "end": 58.92,
          "en": "ResultModal component is output as part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.92,
          "end": 62.883,
          "en": "of the JSX code returned by the TimerChallenge component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.08,
          "end": 66.49,
          "en": "So therefore it's output in the same place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.352,
          "end": 70.62,
          "en": "where this section here is output, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.62,
          "end": 74.64,
          "en": "That's why we see that dialogue next to this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.64,
          "end": 76.953,
          "en": "Here's the section, here's the dialogue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 82.08,
          "en": "Now visually, this actually all works here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 83.973,
          "en": "There's nothing wrong with it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 87.96000000000001,
          "en": "but technically it would make more sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.96000000000001,
          "end": 92.511,
          "en": "if this overlay element which visually sits on top",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.511,
          "end": 97.2,
          "en": "of the entire page would be output directly inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.2,
          "end": 100.8,
          "en": "of the body or maybe inside of this div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.8,
          "end": 103.11,
          "en": "which sits here with an ID of modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.11,
          "end": 106.62299999999999,
          "en": "which I did not add to the starting project by accident.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.33,
          "end": 111.53999999999999,
          "en": "And it would make sense to have the dialogue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.53999999999999,
          "end": 113.19,
          "en": "on such a higher level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.19,
          "end": 117.12,
          "en": "because that would map its visual appearance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.12,
          "end": 120.34,
          "en": "to its location in the HTML structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.29,
          "end": 124.68,
          "en": "which can be better for accessibility reasons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.68,
          "end": 129.15,
          "en": "and which can also help you avoid styling problems.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.15,
          "end": 130.83,
          "en": "Here we don't have any,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.83,
          "end": 133.38,
          "en": "but a deeply nested element could be hidden",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.38,
          "end": 137.55,
          "en": "by other elements above it in certain circumstances.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.55,
          "end": 142.352,
          "en": "And therefore we might wanna control and kind of output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 142.352,
          "end": 146.82,
          "en": "this modal component in the TimerChallenge component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.82,
          "end": 149.51,
          "en": "because that's the component where we use it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.51,
          "end": 154.51,
          "en": "but we'd like its JSX code to go somewhere else in our page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.88,
          "end": 158.52,
          "en": "And that's exactly the kind of problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.52,
          "end": 160.503,
          "en": "this portal feature solves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 162.03,
          "end": 164.73,
          "en": "To use this feature, you have to import something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.73,
          "end": 169.73,
          "en": "and you have to import that something from react-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.86,
          "end": 172.68,
          "en": "So not from the React library itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.68,
          "end": 175.8,
          "en": "but from this React DOM library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.8,
          "end": 179.07,
          "en": "which of course is managed by the same team.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.07,
          "end": 180.513,
          "en": "The difference is basically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.513,
          "end": 184.32,
          "en": "that the React library only exposes functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.32,
          "end": 187.83,
          "en": "and features that work in all kinds of environments.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.83,
          "end": 191.13,
          "en": "For example, also, if you would build a Native app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.13,
          "end": 194.82,
          "en": "with React Native, for which I have a separate course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.82,
          "end": 196.57,
          "en": "if you wanna learn more about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.73,
          "end": 200.82,
          "en": "Whereas the React DOM library includes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.82,
          "end": 203.371,
          "en": "a couple of features and functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.371,
          "end": 207.93,
          "en": "that in the end allow React to then interact with the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 207.93,
          "end": 210.543,
          "en": "So with a website rendered in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.92000000000002,
          "end": 216.12,
          "en": "And one feature, one function exposed by React DOM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 216.12,
          "end": 219.633,
          "en": "which we need here is to createPortal function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.89,
          "end": 224.73,
          "en": "As the name suggests, this is used to create such a portal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.73,
          "end": 228.39,
          "en": "and the idea behind a portal is really just to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 228.39,
          "end": 232.74,
          "en": "kind of teleport this HTML code that will be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 232.74,
          "end": 236.463,
          "en": "by this component into a different place in the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 238.17000000000002,
          "end": 242.13,
          "en": "To achieve this, you simply have to wrap this JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 242.13,
          "end": 247.13,
          "en": "that should be teleported away with createPortal like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 249.18,
          "end": 252.99,
          "en": "And then createPortal takes a second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 252.99,
          "end": 255.273,
          "en": "that comes after this JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 256.38,
          "end": 259.71,
          "en": "So the first argument is this JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 259.71,
          "end": 264.71,
          "en": "The second argument for createPortal then is an HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 265.32,
          "end": 268.38,
          "en": "to which this code should be teleported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 268.38,
          "end": 271.383,
          "en": "So where this code should be rendered in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 272.61,
          "end": 274.83,
          "en": "And that should be an element that exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 274.83,
          "end": 277.62,
          "en": "in your index HTML file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 277.62,
          "end": 281.55,
          "en": "And that's why in that file, I added this special div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 281.55,
          "end": 285.061,
          "en": "with the ID modal in the starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 285.061,
          "end": 290.061,
          "en": "because it's this div where I wanna attach this modal to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 291.18,
          "end": 294.81,
          "en": "So that it's not deeply nested inside of my content here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 294.81,
          "end": 298.713,
          "en": "but instead relatively close to the root of the body.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 300.42,
          "end": 302.52,
          "en": "Therefore, in the result modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 302.52,
          "end": 306.39,
          "en": "in this createPortal function for this second argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 306.39,
          "end": 309.75,
          "en": "you should select that element with a default browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 309.75,
          "end": 313.533,
          "en": "API by using document.getElementById.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 314.61,
          "end": 317.073,
          "en": "And then in my case here, the ID is modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 319.41,
          "end": 323.493,
          "en": "That's the ID I added here by which I'm selecting this div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 325.611,
          "end": 329.52,
          "en": "And this code here, of course, is kind of similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 329.52,
          "end": 333.123,
          "en": "to what you see in the main or index JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 333.96,
          "end": 336.54,
          "en": "There, we have this createRoot method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 336.54,
          "end": 340.08,
          "en": "which also needed an element in the HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 340.08,
          "end": 342.843,
          "en": "where the React app would be rendered to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 343.98,
          "end": 346.32,
          "en": "Now we're doing the same here with a part of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 346.32,
          "end": 350.49,
          "en": "the app with createPortal, so it's still the same React app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 350.49,
          "end": 353.163,
          "en": "just output in a different place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 354.3,
          "end": 355.44,
          "en": "And that's now all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 355.44,
          "end": 357.21,
          "en": "If we now save this and reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 357.21,
          "end": 360,
          "en": "and we let such a timer expire,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 360,
          "end": 362.88,
          "en": "we have the same overlay as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 362.88,
          "end": 366.66,
          "en": "But if we inspect this with the developer tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 366.66,
          "end": 369.54,
          "en": "we can now see that this dialogue is inside of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 369.54,
          "end": 374.54,
          "en": "that modal div here and not inside of that content div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 376.65,
          "end": 378.57,
          "en": "So it's not nested in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 378.57,
          "end": 381.243,
          "en": "but instead here in this modal div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 382.14,
          "end": 385.17,
          "en": "And by the way, there, you see multiple dialogues",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 385.17,
          "end": 387.51,
          "en": "because we have multiple timer challenges,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 387.51,
          "end": 390.903,
          "en": "but only this first dialogue is visible at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 392.58,
          "end": 396.03,
          "en": "And that's the whole idea behind this portal feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 396.03,
          "end": 399.84000000000003,
          "en": "And it's therefore commonly used for use cases like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 399.84000000000003,
          "end": 403.32,
          "en": "So for modals or similar scenarios",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 403.32,
          "end": 406.05,
          "en": "where you have some JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 406.05,
          "end": 407.88,
          "en": "that should actually not be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 407.88,
          "end": 411.45,
          "en": "in the place where you are using it in your app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 411.45,
          "end": 413.973,
          "en": "but somewhere else in your document.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}